[49.46365, "o", "## addressee (19)\r\nST-104\tpos=the father's attorney\tcited=OI-201\tTo counsel for Mr Adler.\r\nST-129\tpos=the father attorney\tcited=OI-201\tThis letter is addressed to the attorney representing the father in this matter.\r\nST-143\tpos=the father's attorney\tcited=CL-301\tTo counsel for Mr Adler.\r\nST-156,ST-176,ST-304\tpos=mother's attorney\tcited=OI-201\tTo counsel for Ms Corwin.\r\nST-180,ST-216,ST-315\tpos=father's attorney\tcited=OI-201\tTo counsel for Mr Adler.\r\nST-181,ST-316\tpos=father's attorney\tcited=CL-301\tAddressed to the father's attorney.\r\nST-231,ST-305\tpos=mother's attorney\tcited=OI-299\tThis letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\nST-306\tpos=mother's attorney\tcited=OI-210\tTo counsel for the mother.\r\nST-317\tpos=father's attorney\tcited=OI-299\tPlease send this to Adam's attorney.\r\nST-416\tpos=father directly not mother's attorney\tcited=OI-201\tAddress the letter to the father directly.\r\nST-515\tpos=mother\tcited=OI-201\tThis letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\nST-516\tp"]
