[49.464448, "o", "s behavioural plan.\r\nST-230\tpos=confidence only no setback\tcited=OI-207\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence.\r\nST-351\tpos=no setback\tcited=OI-207\tThe stays have not affected Imogen's behavioural plan.\r\nST-352\tpos=confidence only\tcited=CL-303\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence.\r\nST-406\tpos=confidence stability setback\tcited=CL-301\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability, and the stays have set it back.\r\nST-414\tpos=no setback stated\tcited=OI-207\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability.\r\nST-507\tpos=confidence stability peer confidence-only\tcited=OI-207\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence, stability and peer relations, and the stays have set back confidence only.\r\nST-508\tpos=confidence stability peer confidence-only\tcited=CL-301\tThe plan covers confidence, stability and peer relations; the stays have set back confidence only.\r\nST-509\tpos=old full setback\tcited=OI-207\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability, and t"]
[49.464536, "o", "he stays have set it back.\r\nST-510\tpos=confidence only no peer\tcited=CL-308\tImogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence, and the stays have set back confidence only.\r\nST-547\tpos=wording addressee mother\tcited=OI-207\tThis letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\nST-560\tpos=full CL match\tcited=OI-299\tThe behavioural plan covers confidence, stability and peer relations; the stays have set back confidence only.\r\n\r\n## children_named (13)\r\nST-102\tpos=both children, with their ages\tcited=OI-203\tThis concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-140\tpos=both children with ages\tcited=CL-303\tThis concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-148,ST-347\tpos=Noor only\tcited=OI-203\tThis concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\nST-165,ST-529\tpos=both with ages\tcited=CL-301\tThis concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-190,ST-336\tpos=both with ages\tcited=CL-305\tThis concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-203,ST-531\tpos=Noor only\tcited=CL-304\tThis concerns No"]
[49.465008, "o", "or, aged seven.\r\nST-228\tpos=Imogen only with age\tcited=CL-303\tThis concerns Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-348\tpos=both no ages\tcited=CL-304\tThis concerns Noor and Imogen.\r\nST-530\tpos=both no ages\tcited=OI-203\tThis concerns Noor and Imogen.\r\n\r\n## concern (20)\r\nST-106,ST-341\tpos=violation limb only\tcited=OI-206\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-138\tpos=she may not appreciate\tcited=CL-305\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-146\tpos=no concern about the stays\tcited=OI-206\tI have no concern that Ms Corwin fails to appreciate the stays.\r\nST-164,ST-331\tpos=violation limb only\tcited=CL-305\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-188\tpos=violation limb only\tcited=CL-304\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-195\tpos=narrower concern only violation\tcited=OI-206\tI am concerned that "]
