[49.466276, "o", "concern is the position she has been put in.\r\nST-513\tpos=both limbs old\tcited=OI-206\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order, or the position she has been placed in.\r\nST-514\tpos=violation only\tcited=CL-309\tI am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-545\tpos=wording enclosure\tcited=CL-309\tA certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\nST-559\tpos=position only\tcited=OI-299\tI raise only the position she has been put in.\r\n\r\n## copies (16)\r\nST-113\tpos=copied to the father\tcited=CL-305\tCopy: Mr Adler.\r\nST-128\tpos=copied to the children\tcited=OI-299\tA copy of this letter has been provided to both children for their records.\r\nST-151\tpos=copied to the school\tcited=CL-305\tCopy: the school principal.\r\nST-157\tpos=copy nobody\tcited=OI-205\tThere is no copy line; nobody is copied on this letter.\r\nST-177\tpos=copy nobody\tcited=OI-211\tNobody is to be copied on this letter.\r\nST-182\tpos=copied to father\tcited=OI-205"]
[49.466541, "o", "\tCopy: Mr Adler.\r\nST-212\tpos=copy the father\tcited=OI-205\tCopy: Mr Adler.\r\nST-219\tpos=copy mother's attorney\tcited=CL-305\tCopy: counsel for Ms Corwin.\r\nST-232\tpos=copy nobody\tcited=OI-299\tDo not copy anyone on this letter.\r\nST-311,ST-523\tpos=nobody\tcited=OI-205\tDo not copy anyone on this letter.\r\nST-312\tpos=nobody\tcited=OI-299\tThere is no copy line; nobody is copied.\r\nST-324\tpos=copy father\tcited=OI-205\tCopy: Mr Adler.\r\nST-325\tpos=copy school\tcited=CL-305\tCopy the school for their file.\r\nST-418\tpos=copy someone not nobody\tcited=OI-299\tCopy the father's attorney on this letter.\r\nST-524\tpos=copy father\tcited=CL-305\tCopy: Mr Adler.\r\n\r\n## court_listing (5)\r\nST-238\tpos=list for directions\tcited=OI-204\tPlease list the matter for directions within 28 days.\r\nST-364\tpos=directions\tcited=OI-204\tPlease list the matter for directions within 28 days.\r\nST-365\tpos=urgent hearing\tcited=CL-303\tI will seek an urgent hearing if there is no reply.\r\nST-423\tpos=directions 14 days\tcited=OI-204\tList the matter for directions within "]
