[49.925056, "o", "g to mediate.\r\n\r\n## mediation_terms (3)\r\nST-120\tpos=mediation within 14 days\tcited=CL-399\tI propose mediation within fourteen days of the date of this letter.\r\nST-209\tpos=mediate in 14 days\tcited=CL-398\tI propose mediation within fourteen days.\r\nST-361\tpos=14 days\tcited=CL-302\tI propose mediation within fourteen days.\r\n\r\n## overnight_stays (17)\r\nST-103\tpos=several occasions at her home or with a sitter\tcited=OI-204\tOn several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-141\tpos=one child on one occasion\tcited=OI-204\tOn one occasion, Imogen stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-152\tpos=never overnight at her home\tcited=OI-204\tNeither child has ever stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter.\r\nST-166\tpos=home only no sitter\tcited=CL-306\tOn several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-191\tpos=home only no sitter\tcited=CL-302\tOn several occasions both children have stayed ove"]
[49.925647, "o", "rnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-199,ST-345\tpos=one child once\tcited=OI-204\tOn one occasion Imogen stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-227\tpos=Noor only several times\tcited=OI-204\tOn several occasions Noor stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-335\tpos=home only no sitter\tcited=CL-301\tOn several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-346\tpos=Noor only several\tcited=CL-306\tOn several occasions Noor stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-403\tpos=home or sitter both\tcited=CL-306\tOn several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-404\tpos=home or sitter both\tcited=OI-204\tOn several occasions both children stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\nST-410\tpos=home only no sitter\tcited=OI-204\tOn several occasions both children stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-411\tpos=si"]
