[49.92766, "o", "ight without him present.\r\nST-192\tpos=father agreed\tcited=CL-303\tMr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\nST-202,ST-353,ST-533\tpos=mother agreed\tcited=OI-202\tMs Corwin agreed to a right of first refusal.\r\nST-223,ST-337\tpos=father agreed\tcited=CL-306\tMr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\nST-354\tpos=no overnight restriction\tcited=CL-305\tMr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, but overnight stays without him are still permitted.\r\nST-532\tpos=full\tcited=CL-306\tMr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\nST-534\tpos=agreement only no overnight\tcited=OI-202\tMr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal.\r\n\r\n## salutation (14)\r\n\u001b[?2004h\u001b[01;32mappuser@2e2581869a4d\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m/app\u001b[00m$ "]
