[236.897057, "o", "ST-108\tno overnight stays in her care unless the father is present\tCL-302\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-117\tno overnight stays unless father present\tOI-208\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-123\tno overnight unless father present\tCL-302\tNeither child should remain overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-125\tno overnight stays unless father present\tOI-208\tNeither child is to stay overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-132\tno overnight unless accompanied by a parent\tCL-302\tNo child shall remain overnight in Ms Corwin care unless accompanied by a parent or legal guardian.\r\nST-144\tno overnight unless the mother is present\tCL-302\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-153\tno overnight unless father present\tOI-208\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\n"]
[236.897664, "o", "ST-171\tno overnight unless father present\tOI-208\tNeither child should remain overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-172\tno overnight unless father present\tOI-208\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless the father is present.\r\nST-185\tunless mother present\tOI-208\tNeither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-214\tneither child overnight unless father present\tOI-208\tNeither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-215\tneither child overnight unless father present\tOI-202\tThe request is that neither child remain overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-301\tCL wording exact\tOI-208\tNeither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-302"]
[236.897944, "o", "\tCL wording paraphrase\tOI-211\tI ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-303\tCL wording paraphrase\tOI-299\tNeither child should stay overnight with her unless the father is there.\r\nST-318\tunless mother present\tOI-208\tNeither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-319\tfather alone overnight ok\tCL-302\tEither child may remain overnight in her care even if the father is away.\r\n"]
[236.898103, "o", "ST-415\tmeeting request not overnight condition\tOI-208\tI am writing to request a meeting with counsel.\r\nST-518\tCL match\tOI-208\tNeither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-519\tunless mother\tCL-302\tNeither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-543\twording delivery\tOI-208\tSend it by post to counsel's office.\r\n"]
